            "line": 169,
            "text": "theorem averagedPressureDifferenceValue_bound {W0 W1 : Space → ℝ}\n    {G : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Space → ℝ}\n    (hW0 : MemLp W0 2) (hW1 : MemLp W1 2)\n    (hG : ∀ i j : Fin 3, Integrable (G i j)) (k : Fin 3) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ ψ : ComplexTest,\n      ‖averagedPressureDifferenceValue W0 W1 G k ψ‖ ≤ C * Real.sqrt (fourierHNormSq 3 ψ)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
